# The build stage compiles from the sources, so the host's build output and
# Gradle caches are excluded (large, they would invalidate the COPY cache and
# could leak host-compiled classes into the image). The tests are not run in
# the image, so their sources are excluded too: a change to a test does not
# rebuild the image.
.gradle/
build/
.kotlin/
src/test/
src/integrationTest/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.log
